block content
    h1 Diarrhea
    p Definition by #[a(href="https://www.mayoclinic.org/diseases-conditions/diarrhea/symptoms-causes/syc-20352241") Mayo Clinic]:
    blockquote Diarrhea — loose, watery and possibly more-frequent bowel movements — is a common problem. Sometimes, it's the only symptom. At other times, it may be associated with other symptoms, such as nausea, vomiting, abdominal pain or weight loss.
